{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDhKaQEXZQ8gLdGCgZce","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019xe81hVPEn648NYVtt1go4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"P=/Users/brenn/.cache/uv/builds-v0/.tmpTDvosJ/bin/python; F=../agent/brace-findings.json; A=\"$P scripts/answer.py $F\"\n$A check E10.1 --met unknown --note \"In-repo writers (loop.py:55,68,133,154; extractor.py:51,78; main.py:76) pass all six identity fields via audit.record and the child identity keeps trace_id (identity.py:50). The gateway, ERP MCP server and payments API code are outside this repo, and no traceparent or correlation header is sent to them (searched app for traceparent/inject/instrument/correlation; none), so their records and trace sharing cannot be confirmed.\"\n$A check E10.2 --met yes --evidence migrations/001_init.sql:121 --quote \"GRANT SELECT, INSERT ON audit_events TO procurement_agent;\" --counter \"Searched app, migrations and deploy for UPDATE/DELETE/TRUNCATE/DROP on audit_events and for other grants; app/audit.py:42 INSERT is the only audit_events statement and line 120 revokes all prior grants. Only approvals/spend_quota/run_start_window get UPDATE.\" --note \"Agent DB role is insert/select only on audit_events.\"\n$A check E10.3 --met yes --evidence app/loop.py:83 --quote \"output = await tool.invoke(use.input, ident)\" --counter \"Listed all nine tools in tools.yaml and the extractor role; grepped app for audit_events (only audit.py:3,42) and for DELETE/UPDATE/TRUNCATE SQL; no tool or ERP pinned op touches audit records. Note: mcp_client.refresh_tools (mcp_client.py:107) skips pin checks, which belongs to E02.\" --note \"No tool or peer in the registry can delete or rewrite audit rows.\"\n$A check E10.4 --met no --evidence app/tools/payments.py:31 --quote '\"Idempotency-Key\": idempotency_key(ident, args),' --note \"The payments call (external vendor api.payments.example-pay.test) sends no run, trace or 